OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump's Board of Peace unveils $2.45bn
OL,4,Aplan to begin Gaza's reconstruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the board admitted substantial
OL,7,Fdonations were still needed, with $18bn
OL,8,Fpledged but only $280 million handed
OL,9,Fover so far. The board estimates full
OL,10,Frecovery and reconstruction will
OL,11,Frequire about $71.4bn over the next
OL,12,Fdecade.
OL,14,FJared Kushner, Gaza Executive Board
OL,15,Fmember and Trump's son-in-law, conceded
OL,16,Fthe project faced "different delays on
OL,17,Fdifferent things, for whatever reason".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
